Changes
=======

v4.0.1 7 May 2026
  * `EncryptHPKE` / `DecryptHPKE` enforce the wrapper's
    `WithAlgorithm` binding at runtime: a mismatched `alg`
    argument is rejected. Previously the binding was consulted at
    `jwk.Import` time only, so bound keys could silently encrypt
    or decrypt under a different ciphersuite than the caller
    intended. Unbound keys remain unconstrained.

v4.0.0 19 Apr 2026
  * First stable v4 release. Tracks github.com/lestrrat-go/jwx/v4 v4.0.0.

v4.0.0-alpha2 13 Apr 2026
  * Compatibility release for jwx/v4 v4.0.0-scratch.15. No code changes.

v4.0.0-alpha1 13 Apr 2026
  * Initial version, hybrid PQ HPKE (HPKE-10-KE, HPKE-11-KE) per
    draft-reddy-cose-jose-pqc-hybrid-hpke. Uses X-Wing KEM
    (cloudflare/circl) and a hand-rolled HPKE key schedule on SHAKE256
    per draft-ietf-hpke-pq.
